{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03990","headline":"三月三日宴王[明]府山亭 · 高球","name":"三月三日宴王[明]府山亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛城春禊，元巳芳年。\n季伦园里，逸少亭前。\n曲中举白，谈际生玄。\n陆离轩盖，凄清管弦。\n萍疎波荡，柳弱风牵。\n未淹欢趣，林溪夕烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高球","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03990.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03990","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}